sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor L as Learner
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant S as Secure Storage
    participant FB as Firebase Auth
    participant API as Laravel API

    Note over F,S: Cold start - session resume
    F->>FB: currentUser
    alt no cached session
        FB-->>F: null
        F->>L: WelcomeScreen
    else cached session exists
        FB-->>F: User object
        F->>FB: getIdToken - auto refresh if expiring
        FB-->>F: fresh idToken - 1h TTL
        F->>S: cache token
        F->>API: GET /api/me + Bearer
        API-->>F: profile + consent_status + email_verified
        F->>L: AppShell or ConsentPending
    end

    Note over F,API: Token expiry during a session
    F->>API: POST /api/lessons/12/complete + Bearer
    API-->>F: 401 token expired
    F->>FB: getIdToken force refresh true
    FB-->>F: new idToken
    F->>API: retry POST /api/lessons/12/complete
    API-->>F: 200 - xp, new badges, level

    Note over L,API: Sign out
    L->>F: taps Sign out
    F->>FB: signOut
    F->>S: clear cached token
    F->>L: WelcomeScreen
